# eth-amm-sim frontend env
#
# Hosted topology (production / Vercel):
#   UI:  https://eth-amm-sim.vercel.app
#   API: https://api-staging-eth-amm-sim.magro.dev (direct; CORS allowlisted)
#   WS:  wss://api-staging-eth-amm-sim.magro.dev/stream
#
# Local topology (`make up` / `npm run dev`):
#   UI:  http://localhost:3000
#   API: /api/* → Vite proxy → http://127.0.0.1:8080
#   WS:  ws://127.0.0.1:8080/stream

# Optional: call Go directly (bypasses /api proxy or Vercel rewrite).
# VITE_API_URL=https://api-staging-eth-amm-sim.magro.dev

# WebSocket (required for HTTPS UI). Production builds use frontend/.env.production.
# VITE_WS_URL=wss://api-staging-eth-amm-sim.magro.dev/stream

# Dev/preview only: where Vite proxies /api/*.
# Defaults to http://127.0.0.1:8080. To develop the UI against Ubuntu:
# VITE_DEV_BACKEND_URL=https://api-staging-eth-amm-sim.magro.dev
# VITE_WS_URL=wss://api-staging-eth-amm-sim.magro.dev/stream
